OL,3,AKatherine Ryan says she feels 'grief
OL,4,Aand relief' after Russell Brand
OL,5,Aconviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FComedian Katherine Ryan has said she
OL,8,Ffeels "grief and relief" after Russell
OL,9,FBrand was convicted of rape and sexual
OL,10,Fassault.
OL,12,FThe Canadian stand-up and TV star said
OL,13,Fthere were "a lot of women speaking
OL,14,Fprivately and quietly" following
OL,15,FThursday's verdict, who feel "a very
OL,16,Fnuanced mix of emotions".
OL,18,FRyan had previously claimed in a BBC TV
OL,19,Fdocumentary interview with Louis
OL,20,FTheroux that there was a "predator" in
OL,21,Fthe entertainment industry.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
