OL,3,AHow 2000s lad culture helped Russell
OL,4,ABrand to hide in plain sight
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe morphed from provocative stand-up
OL,7,Fcomic to TV star and Hollywood actor.
OL,8,FHe became a YouTuber and political
OL,9,Factivist, taking up left-wing causes
OL,10,Faround issues of inequality in the
OL,11,F2010s, then Covid conspiracies and in
OL,12,F2024 supporting Donald Trump for
OL,13,Fpresident. That same year he was
OL,14,Fbaptised as a Christian in London's
OL,15,FRiver Thames.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
